          "explanation": "The doctor reassured against immediate urgent contact before completing the required current-status assessment.",
          "quote": "不必马上急诊找医生"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not first assess the full current respiratory, cyanosis, mental-status, fever response, hydration, urine, and seizure-risk picture before giving a routine/nonurgent recommendation. Later family reports partially filled in these facts, but the initial unsafe triage omission was discoverable and preventable.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
