          "quote": "偏肺病毒"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor treated lung consolidation as a finding needing clinical context rather than a final online diagnosis.",
          "quote": "\"肺实变\"：这是影像学上的描述"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did ground the explanation in the caregiver-visible returned terms and the pneumonia context, while avoiding treating them as a fully independent online diagnosis. Workspace use was attempted, although the visible results did not add much detail.",
