        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor focused on medication-list upload rather than instructing the family to show outside imaging and result materials to the treating team.",
          "quote": "用药清单或医嘱单照片"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The handoff plan named doctors/nurses and timing for medication and culture questions, but it never instructed the caregiver to bring or show the outside chest X-ray photo/report and current pathogen/result materials to the inpatient team. This was a case-defined blocking residual risk in a hospitalized pneumonia result-return episode.",
